WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
Claude has made a change

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:05.600
Ask Claude to walk you through it in the review

00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:12.000
Claude opens the review, comments on lines and scrolls to them

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:16.600
} goes to Claude's first comment, and c replies to it

00:00:16.600 --> 00:00:20.200
C-c C-c sends the reply, and the review stays open

00:00:20.200 --> 00:00:26.000
Claude answers in the review and changes the file

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:30.000
The review follows the files: the new diff, with the answer
